        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 1954 Indianapolis 500\n- Places: Indianapolis Motor Speedway, Speedway Indiana, Indianapolis\n- Organizations: AAA National Championship Trail, World Championship of Drivers\n\nFacts:\n- The 38th International 500-Mile Sweepstakes was held on Monday, May 31, 1954.\n- The 1954 Indianapolis 500 was part of the 1954 AAA National Championship Trail.\n- The 1954 Indianapolis 500 was race 2 of 9 in the 1954 World Championship of Drivers.\n- The Indianapolis Motor Speedway is an automobile racing circuit in Speedway, Indiana, an enclave suburb of Indianapolis, in the United States.\n- The Indianapolis Motor Speedway is at the corner of 16th Street and Georgetown Road, about 6 miles west of Downtown Indianapolis.",
